# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real dealership data. These workbooks contain real customer names, phone
# numbers, addresses and PAN numbers — they should never end up in git
# history, especially if this repository is (or might become) public.
#
# The dashboard works fine without them committed: keep them on your own
# machine for local use, and for a deployed copy (Render, etc.) push new
# months in through the app itself — sidebar -> "Update monthly data" —
# rather than through git.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*.xlsx
data/*.xlsm
!data/.gitkeep
